*~

# OS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Other package managers' lockfiles. This project uses bun, and bun.lock IS
# committed so CI and contributors resolve the same tree.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Deliberately NOT ignored, listed here so nobody adds them later by reflex:
#   bun.lock                  - the lockfile this project actually uses
#   test/fixtures/chain/*.json - captured chain data the hermetic suite needs
#   docs/                     - the design spec is the binding authority for
#                               this library, and CLAUDE.md and README link it

# npm auth written by CI during release
.npmrc
